{"id":"PG-C101","claim_ko":"PostgreSQL relation tag는 database OID와 relation OID, tuple tag는 여기에 block/offset, transaction tag는 XID, VXID tag는 proc number/local transaction id, speculative insertion tag는 XID/token으로 식별된다.","database":"postgresql","revision":"fd2b89854d93d70fe8c9a69d5b8fafd5b9302cfc","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/include/storage/locktag.h","symbol":"SET_LOCKTAG_RELATION","line_start":80,"line_end":87,"file_sha256":"0ffaea18914516886ea4892c642f2274acb65e32b51c9ceca92e1cef1c9c5a81","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/include/storage/locktag.h","symbol":"SET_LOCKTAG_TUPLE","line_start":116,"line_end":123,"file_sha256":"0ffaea18914516886ea4892c642f2274acb65e32b51c9ceca92e1cef1c9c5a81","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/include/storage/locktag.h","symbol":"SET_LOCKTAG_TRANSACTION","line_start":125,"line_end":132,"file_sha256":"0ffaea18914516886ea4892c642f2274acb65e32b51c9ceca92e1cef1c9c5a81","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/include/storage/locktag.h","symbol":"SET_LOCKTAG_VIRTUALTRANSACTION","line_start":134,"line_end":141,"file_sha256":"0ffaea18914516886ea4892c642f2274acb65e32b51c9ceca92e1cef1c9c5a81","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/include/storage/locktag.h","symbol":"SET_LOCKTAG_SPECULATIVE_INSERTION","line_start":143,"line_end":153,"file_sha256":"0ffaea18914516886ea4892c642f2274acb65e32b51c9ceca92e1cef1c9c5a81","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"tuple tag에 relation 식별자가 포함된다는 사실은 automatic parent intent locking을 뜻하지 않는다.","report_locations":["chapters/11-postgresql.html#pg-resource-model"]}
{"id":"PG-C102","claim_ko":"PostgreSQL standard heavyweight lock은 AccessShare부터 AccessExclusive까지 8개 mode를 사용하고 conflict bitmask가 요청 mode와 grant된 mode의 충돌을 결정한다.","database":"postgresql","revision":"fd2b89854d93d70fe8c9a69d5b8fafd5b9302cfc","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/include/storage/lockdefs.h","symbol":"AccessShareLock","line_start":20,"line_end":48,"file_sha256":"7db1a4531f5da94667f2ca498136e6796d89a8ba56115fd90bef198e09a2af68","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/storage/lmgr/lock.c","symbol":"LockConflicts","line_start":63,"line_end":108,"file_sha256":"bad8fb3ce27d2a4bda77c4e030202eb6395665096bb0d6bacced8f5f77d75eb5","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"SQL row-lock strength인 LockTupleMode는 이 mode 집합과 별도 추상화이며 내부 표로 heavyweight arbitration mode에 대응된다.","report_locations":["chapters/11-postgresql.html#pg-resource-model"]}
{"id":"PG-C103","claim_ko":"일반 source relation은 AccessShareLock, FOR UPDATE/SHARE source는 RowShareLock, INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE/MERGE target은 RowExclusiveLock을 사용하며 parser가 연 relation lock은 transaction end까지 유지된다.","database":"postgresql","revision":"fd2b89854d93d70fe8c9a69d5b8fafd5b9302cfc","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/backend/parser/parse_relation.c","symbol":"addRangeTableEntry","line_start":1510,"line_end":1588,"file_sha256":"c96240f99aa48499e01a673762f668fb133b6c9352850fba792da5378e48b400","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/parser/parse_clause.c","symbol":"setTargetTable","line_start":157,"line_end":217,"file_sha256":"c7a514d028a3529b4efbc6b53cfbdb07307c4b6bcbaa0e19c43b6a724edfeb70","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"RowExclusiveLock끼리는 충돌하지 않으므로 같은 relation의 모든 DML을 직렬화하는 table X lock이 아니다.","report_locations":["chapters/11-postgresql.html#pg-resource-model","chapters/11-postgresql.html#pg-account-scenario"]}
{"id":"PG-C104","claim_ko":"shared LOCK은 자원별 grant/wait 상태와 queue를, PROCLOCK은 자원/backend별 hold 상태를, backend-private LOCALLOCK은 mode별 재획득 횟수와 ResourceOwner별 소유를 추적하며 같은 backend의 lock은 서로 block하지 않는다.","database":"postgresql","revision":"fd2b89854d93d70fe8c9a69d5b8fafd5b9302cfc","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/include/storage/lock.h","symbol":"LOCK","line_start":121,"line_end":153,"file_sha256":"9e997e40e45889d6d1b9040440303d244df566546b48e7e6b9d12f99d3767e16","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/include/storage/lock.h","symbol":"PROCLOCK","line_start":159,"line_end":211,"file_sha256":"9e997e40e45889d6d1b9040440303d244df566546b48e7e6b9d12f99d3767e16","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/include/storage/lock.h","symbol":"LOCALLOCK","line_start":217,"line_end":272,"file_sha256":"9e997e40e45889d6d1b9040440303d244df566546b48e7e6b9d12f99d3767e16","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"parallel query lock group은 여러 backend를 같은 owner group처럼 취급하는 추가 규칙을 가진다.","report_locations":["chapters/11-postgresql.html#pg-ownership-lifetime"]}
{"id":"PG-C105","claim_ko":"LockAcquireExtended는 이미 보유한 lock이면 LOCALLOCK count만 증가시키고 eligible weak relation lock이면 per-backend fast path를 시도하며, 그 밖에는 partitioned shared LOCK/PROCLOCK table에서 conflict를 검사한다.","database":"postgresql","revision":"fd2b89854d93d70fe8c9a69d5b8fafd5b9302cfc","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/backend/storage/lmgr/lock.c","symbol":"LockAcquireExtended","line_start":833,"line_end":944,"file_sha256":"bad8fb3ce27d2a4bda77c4e030202eb6395665096bb0d6bacced8f5f77d75eb5","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/storage/lmgr/lock.c","symbol":"EligibleForRelationFastPath","line_start":974,"line_end":1055,"file_sha256":"bad8fb3ce27d2a4bda77c4e030202eb6395665096bb0d6bacced8f5f77d75eb5","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/storage/lmgr/lock.c","symbol":"SetupLockInTable","line_start":1057,"line_end":1122,"file_sha256":"bad8fb3ce27d2a4bda77c4e030202eb6395665096bb0d6bacced8f5f77d75eb5","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"fast path eligibility는 normal relation의 weak modes와 VXID 특수 경로로 제한된다.","report_locations":["chapters/11-postgresql.html#pg-lock-lifecycle"]}
{"id":"PG-C106","claim_ko":"PostgreSQL wait queue는 strict FIFO가 아니라 requester가 이미 가진 conflicting lock과 선행 waiter의 요청을 고려해 삽입 위치를 정하고, 즉시 grant가 안전하면 queue 진입을 생략한다.","database":"postgresql","revision":"fd2b89854d93d70fe8c9a69d5b8fafd5b9302cfc","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/backend/storage/lmgr/proc.c","symbol":"JoinWaitQueue","line_start":1182,"line_end":1362,"file_sha256":"67031da14df638c9df197a8e77649421836ba5ad4eb6097d01b3661d1f69b9a4","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"OS scheduler와 workload에 독립적인 starvation freedom을 이 queue 규칙만으로 보장한다고 주장하지 않는다.","report_locations":["chapters/11-postgresql.html#pg-lock-lifecycle"]}
{"id":"PG-C107","claim_ko":"ProcSleep는 deadlock_timeout 뒤 deadlock 검사를 예약하고 lock_timeout이 0보다 크면 별도 lock wait timeout을 함께 예약하며 latch wait 중 cancel/die interrupt를 처리한다.","database":"postgresql","revision":"fd2b89854d93d70fe8c9a69d5b8fafd5b9302cfc","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/backend/storage/lmgr/proc.c","symbol":"ProcSleep","line_start":1364,"line_end":1534,"file_sha256":"67031da14df638c9df197a8e77649421836ba5ad4eb6097d01b3661d1f69b9a4","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/utils/misc/guc_parameters.dat","symbol":"deadlock_timeout","line_start":626,"line_end":634,"file_sha256":"e308005cebdcbe545fe9fe8635bfcf071dcc5cbb741b599b50cb3ab72ba94a67","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/utils/misc/guc_parameters.dat","symbol":"lock_timeout","line_start":1616,"line_end":1624,"file_sha256":"e308005cebdcbe545fe9fe8635bfcf071dcc5cbb741b599b50cb3ab72ba94a67","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"deadlock_timeout은 lock wait 상한이 아니라 일반적으로 비싼 deadlock 검사를 지연하는 값이다. 실제 scheduling과 wait duration은 runtime으로 측정하지 않았다.","report_locations":["chapters/11-postgresql.html#pg-deadlock-timeout","chapters/11-postgresql.html#pg-errors-pressure"]}
{"id":"PG-C108","claim_ko":"PostgreSQL deadlock 검사는 conflicting holder의 hard edge와 선행 conflicting waiter의 soft edge를 추적하고, 가능한 soft cycle은 wait queue 재배치로 풀며 불가능한 cycle은 deadlock ERROR로 현재 transaction을 중단시킨다.","database":"postgresql","revision":"fd2b89854d93d70fe8c9a69d5b8fafd5b9302cfc","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/backend/storage/lmgr/deadlock.c","symbol":"DeadLockCheck","line_start":205,"line_end":282,"file_sha256":"38a45a2ca98090b3bbdb1ab472f723c5f094323b8c95a9339e371a77e30a7fd6","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/storage/lmgr/deadlock.c","symbol":"FindLockCycle","line_start":428,"line_end":610,"file_sha256":"38a45a2ca98090b3bbdb1ab472f723c5f094323b8c95a9339e371a77e30a7fd6","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/storage/lmgr/deadlock.c","symbol":"DeadLockReport","line_start":1071,"line_end":1139,"file_sha256":"38a45a2ca98090b3bbdb1ab472f723c5f094323b8c95a9339e371a77e30a7fd6","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"predicate-lock serialization failure, buffer-pin deadlock, victim tie-break 전체를 이 claim으로 일반화하지 않는다.","report_locations":["chapters/11-postgresql.html#pg-deadlock-timeout"]}
{"id":"PG-C109","claim_ko":"lock release는 partition lock을 잡은 채 wakable waiter의 lock을 shared state에 먼저 grant한 다음 latch를 깨워, 새 requester가 깨어난 waiter를 추월하는 race를 막는다.","database":"postgresql","revision":"fd2b89854d93d70fe8c9a69d5b8fafd5b9302cfc","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/backend/storage/lmgr/lock.c","symbol":"LockRelease","line_start":2098,"line_end":2108,"file_sha256":"bad8fb3ce27d2a4bda77c4e030202eb6395665096bb0d6bacced8f5f77d75eb5","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/storage/lmgr/lock.c","symbol":"CleanUpLock","line_start":1735,"line_end":1790,"file_sha256":"bad8fb3ce27d2a4bda77c4e030202eb6395665096bb0d6bacced8f5f77d75eb5","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/storage/lmgr/proc.c","symbol":"ProcLockWakeup","line_start":1832,"line_end":1876,"file_sha256":"67031da14df638c9df197a8e77649421836ba5ad4eb6097d01b3661d1f69b9a4","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"깨어난 caller가 tuple/index 조건을 재검사하는 의무는 access method protocol이 별도로 정한다.","report_locations":["chapters/11-postgresql.html#pg-lock-lifecycle"]}
{"id":"PG-C110","claim_ko":"top-level commit은 non-session standard locks를, abort는 session locks까지 release하고, subtransaction commit은 일반 lock을 parent ResourceOwner로 넘기며 subtransaction abort는 해당 owner의 lock을 개별 release한다.","database":"postgresql","revision":"fd2b89854d93d70fe8c9a69d5b8fafd5b9302cfc","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/backend/storage/lmgr/proc.c","symbol":"ProcReleaseLocks","line_start":889,"line_end":916,"file_sha256":"67031da14df638c9df197a8e77649421836ba5ad4eb6097d01b3661d1f69b9a4","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/utils/resowner/resowner.c","symbol":"ProcReleaseLocks","line_start":753,"line_end":799,"file_sha256":"0fd0f9cac6abe6817a6cca5ef3755d9916d9571e5b1c381cb5306e4fb484be27","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"advisory session locks와 prepared transaction ownership은 별도 규칙을 가진다.","report_locations":["chapters/11-postgresql.html#pg-ownership-lifetime","chapters/11-postgresql.html#pg-startup-shutdown"]}
