{"id":"PG-C121","claim_ko":"top-level transaction start는 자신의 VXID owner lock을 먼저 fast path에 설치한 뒤 ProcArray에 VXID를 advertise하여 observer가 공개된 VXID를 owner lock 없이 보는 race를 피한다.","database":"postgresql","revision":"fd2b89854d93d70fe8c9a69d5b8fafd5b9302cfc","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/backend/access/transam/xact.c","symbol":"VirtualXactLockTableInsert","line_start":2199,"line_end":2219,"file_sha256":"b40898eda7d02c7cf4b7671ab3bf1b3d0ea757cf33765f98fe074d98e8382df2","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/storage/lmgr/lock.c","symbol":"VirtualXactLockTableInsert","line_start":4582,"line_end":4614,"file_sha256":"bad8fb3ce27d2a4bda77c4e030202eb6395665096bb0d6bacced8f5f77d75eb5","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"ordinary heap tuple update, FK, unique conflict의 waiter가 VXID를 기다린다는 뜻은 아니다.","report_locations":["chapters/11-postgresql.html#pg-startup-shutdown","chapters/11-postgresql.html#pg-self-lock-boundary"]}
{"id":"PG-C122","claim_ko":"top-level abort도 abort outcome과 ProcArray 종료를 먼저 공개한 뒤 ResourceOwner lock phase에서 locks를 release하고, LockReleaseAll은 top-level transaction 종료 때 own VXID fast-path lock을 정리한다.","database":"postgresql","revision":"fd2b89854d93d70fe8c9a69d5b8fafd5b9302cfc","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/backend/access/transam/xact.c","symbol":"ProcArrayEndTransaction","line_start":2997,"line_end":3032,"file_sha256":"b40898eda7d02c7cf4b7671ab3bf1b3d0ea757cf33765f98fe074d98e8382df2","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/storage/lmgr/lock.c","symbol":"LockReleaseAll","line_start":2306,"line_end":2342,"file_sha256":"bad8fb3ce27d2a4bda77c4e030202eb6395665096bb0d6bacced8f5f77d75eb5","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"server-wide orderly shutdown의 모든 worker/process 순서는 이 transaction cleanup claim에 포함되지 않는다.","report_locations":["chapters/11-postgresql.html#pg-startup-shutdown"]}
{"id":"PG-C123","claim_ko":"shared lock table allocation이 실패하면 acquisition은 out-of-shared-memory ERROR와 max_locks_per_transaction 조정 hint를 낼 수 있고, 이 GUC는 backend 또는 prepared transaction당 예상 lockable object 수로 table 크기를 산정한다.","database":"postgresql","revision":"fd2b89854d93d70fe8c9a69d5b8fafd5b9302cfc","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/backend/storage/lmgr/lock.c","symbol":"max_locks_per_transaction","line_start":1034,"line_end":1091,"file_sha256":"bad8fb3ce27d2a4bda77c4e030202eb6395665096bb0d6bacced8f5f77d75eb5","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/utils/misc/guc_parameters.dat","symbol":"max_locks_per_transaction","line_start":2029,"line_end":2037,"file_sha256":"e308005cebdcbe545fe9fe8635bfcf071dcc5cbb741b599b50cb3ab72ba94a67","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"설정값은 transaction별 hard cap이 아니라 shared-table sizing assumption이며 실제 memory byte 수는 이 claim에서 계산하지 않는다.","report_locations":["chapters/11-postgresql.html#pg-errors-pressure","chapters/11-postgresql.html#pg-performance-observability"]}
{"id":"PG-C124","claim_ko":"pg_locks는 pg_lock_status가 수집한 heavyweight 및 predicate lock 상태를 노출하고 pg_blocking_pids는 conflicting holder와 wait queue에서 앞선 conflicting waiter를 blocker로 보고하며, long wait와 acquisition failure logging은 GUC로 제어된다.","database":"postgresql","revision":"fd2b89854d93d70fe8c9a69d5b8fafd5b9302cfc","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/backend/catalog/system_views.sql","symbol":"pg_locks","line_start":439,"line_end":440,"file_sha256":"6203864baafee05bda77106d6e1bafd48a6ec902f3361b0f4ecda3b9bc2cc9e2","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/utils/adt/lockfuncs.c","symbol":"pg_lock_status","line_start":93,"line_end":162,"file_sha256":"25318bcb3c2822e5d4f2268f62684d28b70fce21c968684bc85be0eef3b9a613","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/utils/adt/lockfuncs.c","symbol":"pg_blocking_pids","line_start":448,"line_end":562,"file_sha256":"25318bcb3c2822e5d4f2268f62684d28b70fce21c968684bc85be0eef3b9a613","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/utils/misc/guc_parameters.dat","symbol":"log_lock_failures","line_start":1745,"line_end":1755,"file_sha256":"e308005cebdcbe545fe9fe8635bfcf071dcc5cbb741b599b50cb3ab72ba94a67","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"pg_locks snapshot에는 관측 시점 race와 fast-path 표현 차이가 있고 tuple header XMAX/MultiXact의 모든 logical row lock이 독립 tuple row로 보이지 않는다.","report_locations":["chapters/11-postgresql.html#pg-performance-observability"]}
{"id":"PG-C125","claim_ko":"weak relation locks와 VXID owner locks의 fast path는 자주 획득하지만 드물게 충돌하는 lock이 shared lock-table partition을 경합시키는 비용을 줄이고, strong conflicting relation request가 나타나면 관련 fast-path locks를 main table로 옮긴다.","database":"postgresql","revision":"fd2b89854d93d70fe8c9a69d5b8fafd5b9302cfc","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/backend/storage/lmgr/README","symbol":"Fast Path Locking","line_start":257,"line_end":304,"file_sha256":"381d8acfeeb061030a495a5fd72755361e2f14e98b168aa1b0efbcae55531874","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"pinned source의 설계 목적이며 이 report에서 throughput, cache miss, CUBRID 대비 성능을 측정하지 않았다.","report_locations":["chapters/11-postgresql.html#pg-performance-observability"]}
{"id":"PG-C126","claim_ko":"XactLockTableWait는 XID tag에 ShareLock을 잡았다가 즉시 풀고 running status를 재검사하며, subtransaction XID lock이 먼저 사라졌으면 topmost parent XID로 반복하고 ProcArray가 lock registration보다 앞선 드문 관측은 짧은 retry로 처리한다.","database":"postgresql","revision":"fd2b89854d93d70fe8c9a69d5b8fafd5b9302cfc","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/backend/storage/lmgr/lmgr.c","symbol":"XactLockTableWait","line_start":648,"line_end":730,"file_sha256":"7301f269a04cb423ff830d5490300185cf7b36c675b515638cda235125688eaf","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/backend/access/transam/xact.c","symbol":"CommitSubTransaction","line_start":5151,"line_end":5236,"file_sha256":"b40898eda7d02c7cf4b7671ab3bf1b3d0ea757cf33765f98fe074d98e8382df2","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"tuple에 XID를 게시하는 writer path는 AssignTransactionId가 owner lock을 획득한 뒤 진행하지만 non-tuple ProcArray consumer의 race handling까지 동일하다고 일반화하지 않는다.","report_locations":["chapters/11-postgresql.html#pg-self-lock-boundary","chapters/11-postgresql.html#pg-invariants-limits"]}
